{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2021-07-27 16:15:00', 'title': 'COMERICA DECLARES COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'DALLAS, JULY 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF COMERICA INCORPORATED (NYSE: CMA) DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND FOR COMMON STOCK OF 68 CENTS ($0.68) PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE OCT. 1, 2021, TO COMMON STOCK SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON SEPT.'}